1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,079
NYC asked Musk's SpaceXAI: if your AI causes
a death, will you accept responsibility?

2
00:00:07,029 --> 00:00:12,507
It took a subpoena to get it to City Hall.
It came by video.

3
00:00:13,557 --> 00:00:18,936
Its answer? "We're responsible for
following the law."

4
00:00:19,986 --> 00:00:25,364
How many staff work on safety? "Everybody
is in charge of safety."

5
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:31,943
Everybody is in charge. So nobody is.
